    "html": "<h2 id=\"section-本月可观测热文回顾\">本月可观测热文回顾<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-本月可观测热文回顾\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：本月可观测热文回顾\">#</a></h2><p><br></p><p><strong><span>文章一览：</span></strong></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.3.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587683&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0e910cf6f0cfd72474bb7a1c14fb7050&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">告别手动补索引：SLS 支持索引自动发现，让数据开箱即用、自由分析</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.4.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587677&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=235b2cf8ae60323f85a52fde310fd211&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">从 HTTP 200 到第一个有效输出：AI SSE 拨测如何量化流式体验</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.5.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587564&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=68e1233103f69e8f7b6dced1ad766dda&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI 语音一直“正在连接”？用 RUM 排查 WebSocket 建连问题</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.6.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587510&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=da0ddd3b3efed9d9d14c5bf0cc7b921c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">从页面渲染到智能体：ARMS Node.js 探针解锁 SSR + AI 全链路可观测</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.7.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587485&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7838aa907d18bf5a9822aa7d98f798e0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">阿里云发布 AgenticOps 全栈能力，让 Agent 成为运维与研发的第一用户</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.8.14586ffajfdbS8&amp;__biz=MzUzNzYxNjAzMg==&amp;mid=2247587425&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e0cc8ed663aaed44